<body data-page="04"><nav data-site-nav aria-label="dSpark 学习页面"></nav><main class="page page--wide">
  <header class="hero"><p class="eyebrow">04 · 置信度 / 预算 / 布局</p><h1>历史存活率决定“多算多少”；当前存活率决定“把名额给谁”</h1><p class="lead">在 adaptive mode 且已配置预算调度时，<code>DSparkVerifyPlanner</code> 在 Target launch 前汇合两条时间轴：两轮前统计结合 SPS 成本选择 batch-global budget；本轮 proposal 的置信度再用全局 top-k 生成每请求 <code>verify_lens</code>。</p><div class="evidence-strip"><span><strong>不变量</strong> · budget 只数 anchor 之外的 extra slots</span><span><strong>不变量</strong> · verify_lens 包含 mandatory anchor</span><span><strong>结论</strong> · <code>layout=None</code> 不等于跳过 Target</span><span><strong>证据</strong> · 当前源码 <code>f01a0c7f97ec</code></span></div><div class="route-switch"><button type="button" data-route-choice="static-greedy">STATIC · 贪心</button><button type="button" data-route-choice="compact-sampling">COMPACT · 随机采样</button><button type="button" data-route-choice="folded-greedy">FOLDED · 贪心</button></div><div data-semantic-legend></div></header>
  <section class="handoff"><div class="handoff__item"><b>输入 · 当前轮</b><span><code>proposal : DraftProposal</code>、当前 <code>confidence[B,G]</code>、prefix/request indices。</span></div><div class="handoff__item"><b>输入 · 历史轮</b><span>overlap 从 <code>FutureMap</code> 预写 budget；non-overlap 由 Host planner 同步推进 carry。</span></div><div class="handoff__item"><b>输出</b><span><code>budget</code>、<code>layout : Optional[RaggedVerifyLayout]</code>、<code>run_compact</code>。</span></div><div class="handoff__item"><b>下一消费者</b><span><code>self : DSparkWorkerV2</code> 按 <code>run_compact</code> 进入 05 的 <code>TargetVerifyExecutor</code>。</span></div></section>
  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="planner-title"><div class="section__head"><p class="section__kicker">主视图 · 两条统计轨汇流</p><h2 id="planner-title">同一轮同时使用 <code>C_(t-2)</code> 和 <code>C_t</code>，但用途完全不同</h2><p class="section__intro">黄色历史轨只产生一个 batch-global scalar；蓝色当前轨先独立求每请求 survival，再共享这个 scalar 做全局排名。两次 <code>cumprod</code> 不要合并。</p></div>
    <div class="visual stepper" data-stepper data-steps="6"><div class="visual__bar"><span><strong>B=2 · G=4 · W=5</strong> · budget=2，verify_lens=[2,2]</span><button class="zoom-button" type="button" data-zoom-target="#planner-canvas">放大主图</button></div><div class="visual__body"><div class="stepper__toolbar"><div class="stepper__buttons"><button type="button" data-step-action="prev">上一步</button><button type="button" data-step-action="next">下一步</button><button type="button" data-step-action="play">播放</button><button type="button" data-step-action="reset">重置</button></div><div class="stepper__progress"><span data-step-progress></span></div><div class="stepper__status" data-step-status></div></div><div class="canvas-scroll"><div id="planner-canvas" class="two-track">
      <div class="track" data-kind="guard"><div class="track-label" data-step-node="0">历史收益轨<br><code>C_(t-2)</code><br>决定“多少”</div><article class="track-stage" data-step-node="0"><b>历史 confidence</b><code>req0 [.90,.80,.50,.20]<br>req1 [.70,.60,.50,.40]</code><p>默认稳态 lag=2；持有者随 overlap 模式变化。</p></article><article class="track-stage" data-step-node="1"><b>历史 survival</b><code>req0 [.900,.720,.360,.072]<br>req1 [.700,.420,.210,.084]</code><p><code>cumprod(C_(t-2))</code></p></article><article class="track-stage" data-step-node="2"><b>SPS 目标函数</b><code>tau_star(k)=B+prefixSum(top-k)<br>theta=tau_star×SPS</code><p>收益增加同时考虑 Target step 成本档位。</p></article><article class="track-stage" data-step-node="2"><b>raw budget</b><code>argmax theta(k) = 2</code><p>全 batch 额外开放两个 draft 槽，不含 anchor。</p></article><article class="track-stage" data-step-node="3"><b>resolve budget</b><code>resolve_verify_token_budget()<br>→ 2</code><p>overlap 读预写值；non-overlap 同步计算。</p></article></div>
      <div class="track" data-kind="data"><div class="track-label" data-step-node="0">当前分配轨<br><code>C_t</code><br>决定“给谁”</div><article class="track-stage" data-step-node="0"><b>当前 confidence</b><code>req0 [.95,.90,.70,.20]<br>req1 [.99,.95,.92,.85]</code><p>来自刚返回 proposal 或现场 confidence head。</p></article><article class="track-stage" data-step-node="1"><b>当前 survival</b><code>req0 [.950,.855,.5985,.1197]<br>req1 [.990,.9405,.8653,.7355]</code><p>再次独立 <code>cumprod(C_t)</code>。</p></article><article class="track-stage" data-step-node="3"><b>全局 top-k</b><code>#1 req1.pos0=.990<br>#2 req0.pos0=.950</code><p>消费上轨 budget=2。</p></article><article class="track-stage" data-step-node="4"><b>每请求长度</b><code>selected_extra=[1,1]<br>verify_lens=1+[1,1]=[2,2]</code><p>1 是 mandatory anchor floor。</p></article><article class="track-stage" data-step-node="5"><b>RaggedVerifyLayout</b><code>logical rows=4<br>graph tier=5</code><p>本例一个物理槽只是图 padding。</p></article></div>
      <div class="merge-note" data-step-node="5"><span></span><div><strong>汇流点：</strong><code>DSparkVerifyPlanner.schedule_layout()</code> 把当前 confidence 与（可能经 graph-tier alignment 放大的）budget 传给 <code>ScheduleVerifyLensTopk.execute()</code>。</div></div>
    </div></div><div class="metric-strip metrics"><div><b>原始预算</b><span>2 extra</span></div><div><b>强制锚点基线</b><span>2 anchors</span></div><div><b>verify_lens</b><span>[2,2]</span></div><div><b>逻辑行</b><span>4</span></div><div><b>CUDA 图档位*</b><span>5</span></div></div></div></div>
  </section>
  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="mode-title"><div class="section__head"><p class="section__kicker">辅助视图 · 三种布局状态机</p><h2 id="mode-title"><code>layout</code> 控制是否压紧 Target 输入，不控制 Target 是否运行</h2><p class="section__intro">三种 mode 始终可见；当前 route 只高亮对应教学路径。sampling/greedy 不改变本页的长度分配公式。</p></div>
    <div class="visual"><div class="visual__bar"><span><strong>状态机</strong> · mode → layout → run_compact → 05 Target 行数</span><button class="zoom-button" type="button" data-zoom-target="#mode-machine">放大辅助图</button></div><div class="visual__body" id="mode-machine"><div class="mode-machine">
      <article class="mode-card" data-routes="static-greedy"><h3>STATIC</h3><div class="state-flow"><span>schedule_layout()</span><span>None</span><span>run_non_compact</span></div><dl><dt>budget planner</dt><dd>未构造</dd><dt>layout</dt><dd>None</dd><dt>Target forward</dt><dd>完整 B×W=10 行</dd><dt>含义</dt><dd>不做 ragged 调度</dd></dl></article>
      <article class="mode-card" data-kind="guard" data-routes="compact-sampling"><h3>CAP_ACCEPT</h3><div class="state-flow"><span>layout 可能存在</span><span>run_non_compact</span><span>accept cap</span></div><dl><dt>budget</dt><dd>0…B·G</dd><dt>layout</dt><dd>可能非 None</dd><dt>Target forward</dt><dd>仍是完整 10 行</dd><dt>含义</dt><dd>只限制 06 接受长度</dd></dl></article>
      <article class="mode-card" data-kind="main" data-routes="compact-sampling folded-greedy"><h3>COMPACT</h3><div class="state-flow"><span>layout</span><span>run_compact=true</span><span>05 gather/forward/scatter</span></div><dl><dt>layout 存在</dt><dd>压紧 Target</dd><dt>layout=None</dt><dd>回退完整 Target</dd><dt>无 SPS profile</dt><dd>缓存 uniform verify-all layout</dd><dt>folded</dt><dd>另一个维度</dd></dl></article>
    </div></div></div>
    <div class="callouts" style="margin-top:18px"><div class="callout" data-kind="guard"><b>budget=0</b><p>是有效决策：top-k 不选 extra，但每请求仍有 anchor floor；B=2 时 <code>verify_lens=[1,1]</code>。</p></div><div class="callout" data-kind="data"><b>budget=None</b><p>表示本轮没有 budget 控制信息；<code>_schedule_verify_lens()</code> 返回 None，再由 mode fallback 决定 layout。</p></div><div class="callout" data-kind="fail"><b>layout=None 的误读</b><p>它只让 <code>should_run_compact()</code> 为 false；Worker 随后调用 <code>run_non_compact()</code>，Target 仍 forward。</p></div><div class="callout" data-kind="main"><b>无 SPS profile</b><p>COMPACT 直接复用 uniform verify-all layout；没有预算收益，但仍保持 compact 图/元数据形态。</p></div></div>
    <div class="next-topics"><a data-nav href="dspark-budget-history-sps.html"><b>04A · 两轮历史与 SPS 预算实验室 →</b><span>追踪 overlap/non-overlap 的 lag 持有者，并逐项算出 <code>budget=2</code>。</span></a><a data-nav href="dspark-survival-topk-layout.html"><b>04B · 当前 Survival / Top-k / Layout →</b><span>逐格排名，并切换 graph-tier alignment 比较 <code>[2,2]</code> 与 <code>[2,3]</code>。</span></a></div>
  </section>
  <details class="source-details"><summary>为什么、失败边界与源码锚点</summary><div class="source-details__body"><div class="callouts"><div class="callout" data-kind="main"><b>为什么必须在这里</b><p>DraftProposal 返回后才有当前 token/confidence；Target launch 前又是最后一个可以减少物理验证行的时点。</p></div><div class="callout" data-kind="fail"><b>如果历史身份未校验</b><p>req pool slot 被复用时会继承旧 survival；generation 不匹配必须回退全 1。</p></div></div><div class="source-anchor"><code>python/sglang/srt/speculative/dspark_components/dspark_worker_v2.py:538–612</code><span>Worker 取得 confidence、budget/layout、计算 run_compact 并分派 05。</span></div><div class="source-anchor"><code>python/sglang/srt/speculative/dspark_components/dspark_planner.py:254–293, 351–618</code><span>confidence、budget resolve、layout、alignment 与 top-k 调度入口。</span></div><div class="source-anchor"><code>python/sglang/srt/speculative/dspark_components/dspark_planner.py:948–1118</code><span>历史 survival、SPS objective、lag carry 与 generation guard。</span></div><div class="source-anchor"><code>python/sglang/kernels/ops/speculative/dspark/dspark_schedule.py:19–115</code><span>当前 confidence 的 cumprod、稳定 top-k、selected_extra 与 anchor floor。</span></div></div></details>
